<title>CANADA: Bombardier Q4 share net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Bombardier Q4 share net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periods ended January 31.</p>
<p>				1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.42     loss	C$0.15</p>
<p> Net	 profit     147,300     loss	49,900</p>
<p> Revs		   2,500,000		2,700,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$1.16   profit	C$0.45</p>
<p> Net	 profit     406,200   profit     158,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,000,000		7,100,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 336,100		  333,000</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Bombardier Inc. Previous year results included a fourth-quarter writedown of C$105.1 million related to shares in Eurotunnel</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
